  "answer": "The bundle itself doesn't deploy any machines. On kite, ai-platform-bundle has cloud_provider none and an empty expected_instances list. It is a parent that points at two sub_components: base -> ai-platform.base-ocp, and accelerators -> ai-platform.gpu-nodes.\n\nThe GPU part is ai-platform.gpu-nodes on kite:\n- cloud_provider aws, env_type ocp4-workload-gpu-machineset\n- expected_instances: 4 x g6e.12xlarge, purpose gpu-worker\n- defined in rhpds/agnosticv at ai-platform/gpu-nodes/common.yaml (scm_ref main)\n\nSo each order asks for 4 g6e.12xlarge GPU workers on top of the base cluster. That is the figure for your quota request.\n"
